1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,030
This is Pip. Pip wants to see a waterfall.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,810
Search Chitrakote, in Bastar, Chhattisgarh.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,870
38 km from Jagdalpur, on the Indravati River.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,430
29 m high, and the widest falls in India.

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,880
But when should Pip go?

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,630
Switch to monsoon.

7
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:32,810
Nearly 300 m of roaring water. The Niagara of India.

8
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:39,490
Go between July and October. Trip saved.
